  "scope": "Add an ordered normalized IR page-text view while retaining original line/block strings, segments, positions, visual/form evidence and reading-order/Unicode diagnostics. Whole text equality handles repeated-word wrapping; unique exact block anchors only bound contiguous windows. Never cancel word bags. Optional legacy None means uncomputed. Trimmed grapheme-pair work is capped at 4,000,000 per page; coarse fallback preserves all text and requires review. Does not reconstruct paragraph/table semantics or repair unknown reading order. Page status compares ordered normalized text after excluding ONLY independently proven minor block IDs, rather than rejecting a whole anchor window containing unchanged repeated body. Raw page-text evidence still includes those numbers. Real body order changes remain substantive even within configured position tolerance.",
